qcom-va-driver (1.1.1+gitee8622c-0diting3) resolute; urgency=medium

  * patches/0002: a new bit rate and frame rate is taken while the session
    runs (drain, then the controls), where upstream refused it. A browser
    changes the bit rate every second or two without a new context.
    tests/encoder/rate-change goes with it: one session, the rate changes
    twice and the frame rate once.

